        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div>\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/v2+TWoR-Open+Day_Website+Banner+1200+by+700+v2.png\" />\n</div>\n<div>\n  <h4>\n    <span>\n      \n           Explore your study options for 2025\n          \n    </span>\n  </h4>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <span>\n        \n            Nau mai haere mai ki Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa! We're opening our doors to the general public!\n           \n      </span>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      \n           Come and find out who we are and what makes our qualifications unique.\n          \n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Meet some of our p\u016bkenga (tutors)\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Interactive activities\n           \n      </span>\n      <span>\n        <span>\n          \n             \ufeff\n            \n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Enrolment support\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Get course information\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Study advice\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Campus tours\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <span>\n        \n            Kai timo (There will be kai available)\n           \n      </span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>\n    <span>\n      <br />\n    </span>\n  </p>\n</div>"
      }
